WEBVTT

00:03:28.663 --> 00:03:30.957
above 2020 levels.

00:03:31.666 --> 00:03:36.003
Of course, unlike the 1.5 Celsius figure,

00:03:36.045 --> 00:03:39.340
which is a scientifically
robust threshold,

00:03:39.382 --> 00:03:44.011
the two-percent figure represents
only a rough guesstimate.

00:03:44.553 --> 00:03:48.099
It should be understood
as a ballpark figure

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:49.433
that can help to frame

00:03:49.475 --> 00:03:52.687
the kind of political project
humanity requires.

00:03:53.187 --> 00:03:57.233
It tells us that preventing
catastrophic climate change

00:03:57.275 --> 00:04:00.611
is a totally feasible project,